      <title>苹果M6 iMac或2026年底发布，两年一更的节奏让老用户纠结</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai/post/20260823/%E8%8B%B9%E6%9E%9CM6-iMac%E6%88%962026%E5%B9%B4%E5%BA%95%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83%E4%B8%A4%E5%B9%B4%E4%B8%80%E6%9B%B4%E7%9A%84%E8%8A%82%E5%A5%8F%E8%AE%A9%E8%80%81%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%E7%BA%A0%E7%BB%93/</link>
